#: ../../../how-to/software/index.md:8
msgid "Install or remove software"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/index.md:10
msgid ""
"By default, many useful programs are already installed when you set up "
"Ubuntu on your computer. However, you may need a particular piece of "
"software for a purpose not served by the default applications."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/index.md:12
msgid ""
"You can install applications and other software that comes from Ubuntu or "
"third-party sources. You can also update or uninstall software."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/index.md:14
msgid ""
